# FAN: KvCache (EFC_Brain_KvCache)

```yaml
efc_id:   "EFC_BRAIN_KV_001"
rfn:      "RFN://brain.runtime.kv_cache"

input:
  I1: "model_spec: ModelSpec { n_layers, n_kv_heads, head_dim }"
  I2: "max_seq_len: usize â€” E4 default 512"

process:
  P1: "Allocate Vec<f32> sized [n_layers * max_seq * n_kv_heads * head_dim * 2]"
  P2: "Split into k_cache / v_cache views"

output:
  O1: "KvCache { k: Vec<f32>, v: Vec<f32>, shape: KvShape }"

error:
  E1: "KvError::AllocFailed â€” seq_len > max_seq_len, return Err not panic"
  E2: "KvError::InvalidShape â€” n_layers=0 or head_dim=0"

memory_budget:
  qwen2_0_5b_512:  "25.2 MB (n_layers=24, max_seq=512, kv_heads=8, head_dim=64)"
  qwen2_0_5b_2048: "100.7 MB â€” WARNING: risky on PI device, use 512 default"

crate_path:    "brain/master/src/runtime/kv_cache.rs"
hacedle_kvm:   "fem/hacedle/src/x/loader/kvm/mod.rs â€” 0.44KB stub, not reusable yet"
```

