# FAN: Prefill (EFC_Brain_Prefill)

```yaml
efc_id:   "EFC_BRAIN_PREFILL_001"
rfn:      "RFN://brain.runtime.prefill"

input:
  I1: "token_ids: &[u32]"
  I2: "kv: &mut KvCache"
  I3: "engine: &HacedleKernel"

process:
  for pos in 0..token_ids.len():
    emb = engine.embed(token_ids[pos])
    hs  = engine.forward_all_layers(pos, emb, kv)  # updates kv in-place
  return hs  # hidden_state of last token

output:
  O1: "last_hidden: Vec<f32>[hidden_size]"

error:
  E1: "RuntimeError::LayerFailed { layer, msg } â€” no panic"
  E2: "RuntimeError::KvFull â€” seq too long for cache"

crate_path: "brain/master/src/runtime/prefill.rs"
```

