# FAN: Sampler (EFC_Brain_Sample)

```yaml
efc_id:   "EFC_BRAIN_SAMPLE_001"
rfn:      "RFN://brain.runtime.sampler"

input:
  I1: "logits: &[f32]  â€” shape [vocab_size]"
  I2: "strategy: SampleStrategy"

strategies:
  Greedy: "argmax(logits) â€” O(vocab) scan, zero alloc"
  TopK:   "partial_sort top-k, sample with softmax â€” E4 default k=40"
  TopP:   "nucleus â€” E4.5, defer"

output:  "next_token_id: u32"
error:
  E1: "SampleError::NanLogits â€” replace nan with -inf before argmax"
  E2: "SampleError::EmptyVocab â€” logits.len()==0"

crate_path: "brain/master/src/runtime/logits.rs"
```
